{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","彗星怒矢"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","彗星の矢"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","射出彗星箭矢，对路径上的敌人造成伤害，在区域内的其他友军普通攻击会召唤流星造成一次额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","彗星の矢を放ち、軌道上の敵にダメージを与える。軌道上の他の味方が通常攻撃を行うたびに、流星を召喚し、追加でダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向射出一支彗星箭矢，对箭矢沿途5格宽度内的所有敌人造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并留下一片“群星投影”，持续7秒，在“群星投影”内的其他友军使用普通攻击时，会同时召唤流星攻击目标，对其造成该友军50%攻击力的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","選んだ方向に彗星の矢を放ち、幅5マスの直線上の敵に200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、「群星の輝き」を7秒間残す。「群星の輝き」範囲内にいる他の味方が通常攻撃を行うと、流星が降り注ぎ、追加で攻撃対象にその味方の攻撃力×50%のダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが240% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/d