が50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当场上敌人存在护盾时，流星会发射一枚陨石攻击该目标，造成350% ATK的伤害，若成功破坏护盾，则眩晕目标4秒。流星每10秒至多发射一枚陨石。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","フィールド上にシールドを持つ敵が存在する場合、流星はその敵に隕石を1発放ち、350% ATKのダメージを与える。この攻撃で対象のシールドが破壊された場合、対象に4秒間のスタンを付与。流星は10秒ごとに、隕石を1発まで発射可能"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":38,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成450% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが450% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人额外降低护甲。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","スキル「彗星の矢」を受けた敵の物理防御がDOWN"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“彗星怒矢”命中的敌人在6秒内降低25%护甲。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","スキル「彗星の矢」を受けた敵は6秒間、物理防御-25%"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","额外获得300点初始能量。技能“彗星怒矢”留下的“群星投影”时间延长7秒，并且友军攻击召唤的流星会附带莱卡40% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","初期SP+300。必殺技「彗星の矢」の「群星の輝き」の持続時間+7秒、味方の攻撃で召喚された流星により、追加で攻撃対象にライカの40% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":64,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星辰之弦"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","星辰の弦"]]}